  "Scope": "Fixed dfcc96ad -\u003E78f19fd4. Twelve equal-result public Core/PCRE2 Count, PCRE2 text/native Replace and caller-destination TryReplace cases. Existing byte-template APIs in both sources, with no host conversion added. Warm one template; cold32 same-size templates exceed16entry cache. Complete operation including native first preparation and finite/live-token policy. Setup outside timing. Complete output batches checked after timing; destination case reuses one fixed caller buffer with invariant output. Warm1.5s/min1000calls/lane,independent80ms calibration,3alternating samples,all\u003E=20ms. One120s cap; at most one focused noise confirmation. No catalog/cumulative/package/funded-replacement claim.",
